1. `default_config_dir_ends_with_bivvy` -- `BivvyDirs::default().user_config_file()` path contains "bivvy" and ends with "config.yml".
2. `default_data_dir_ends_with_bivvy` -- `BivvyDirs::default().sessions_dir()` ends with "sessions".
