```

This delegates to the centralized module, gaining BIVVY_HOME support. The public function signature stays the same so callers (`src/cli/commands/cache.rs`, `src/registry/resolver.rs`) need no changes.

**G. `src/session/mod.rs` (lines 18-23) -- consolidation**

The `default_store_path()` function currently does:
